    \textbf{\code{dsl::StaticRegex<>}} \\
    \midrule
    Declaration & line 6175 & line 10363 \\
    Algorithm & recursive backtracking & Thompson NFA simulation \\
    Input type & \code{std::string_view} &
    \code{std::span<const std::byte>} or \code{std::string_view} \\
    Entry points & \code{matches} only &
    \code{matches}, \code{prefix}, \code{search} \\
    Anchoring & both ends, always &
    \code{matches} requires the whole input; \code{prefix} takes the
    longest prefix; \code{search} is leftmost \\
